# Docker build context: the SPA's node_modules must never reach the build
# stage (the webui stage installs deps itself from the lockfile), and the
# data dir, git metadata, and local build artifacts do not belong in the
# image build context at all (smaller context, no secret/SQLite leakage).
.git
.github
data
docker
docs
design
webui/node_modules
webui/e2e/.artifacts*
webui/dist
*.db
*.db-shm
*.db-wal
*.key